Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:27:48 +0200
Subject: Console defaults for a fresh configuration: the lean graphics,
 fullscreen at the desktop's resolution

A fresh configuration (no config.xml, or one without a key) now starts as
the benchmarks' lean settings, which are the playable ones on the PS3:
HD textures off (textures capped at 512, max_texture_size), important
particles only, drivers not animated, no minimap. Texture compression
stays on (the game's default), the old-driver popup is off (its warning is
meaningless on the PS3), and the game starts fullscreen at the desktop's
resolution (real_width and real_height 0 mean the desktop, resolved in
IrrDriver::initDevice) instead of a 1024x768 window.

A configuration file that has a key keeps its value.

